OL,3,APope diagnosed with lung cancer but had
OL,4,Asuccessful surgery, Vatican says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has been diagnosed with
OL,7,Flung cancer but had successful surgery
OL,8,Fto remove a lower lobe of his right
OL,9,Flung, the Vatican has said in a medical
OL,10,Fbulletin.
OL,12,FThe 71-year-old underwent a 90-minute
OL,13,Fsurgery on Tuesday at Rome's Gemelli
OL,14,FHospital and was subsequently diagnosed
OL,15,Fwith lung adenocarcinoma - a type of
OL,16,Fcancer usually found in the outer part
OL,17,Fof the organ.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
